# spec: the 700 writes EQ with SETGET [1.7] [value, band], one band at a time, without authentication, and answers each write with the full [1.7] state.
# source: hardware report on firmware 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590: SETGET [1.7] 01 02 on f60a0a00f60a0001f60a0002 returned f60a0a00f60a0001f60a0102. The replies below follow that [1.7] layout, starting from the captured state.
device nc700
call set_eq 10 0 1
send 01 07 02 02 0a 00
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 0a 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
send 01 07 02 02 00 01
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 0a 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
send 01 07 02 02 01 02
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 0a 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 01 02
result ok
